#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:16 c23b36c8fd3a4f4b905cd5565089fe27
msgid "Abstract base class for audio effects in the FMOD audio system."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffect**    是所有 FMOD 音频效果资源的基类。它负责把效果创建出的 DSP 应用到    ``FmodChannelGroup``   "
"，并保存当前所属总线和 DSP 链。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:21 19082cd1bbe0471ea9aef5d96407349e
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:23 25395ff663e744dda89014b23f649fba
msgid ""
"Base resource for FMOD audio effects such as Amplify, Filter, EQ, Reverb, and Delay. Add a "
"configuration resource to a :ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` with "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_add_bus_effect>`. A "
"configuration can be shared by several slots; each slot receives a separate runtime instance and "
"DSP chain. Parameter changes update the bound instances without rebuilding their DSPs."
msgstr ""
"FMOD 效果器的基类资源，包含 Amplify、Filter、EQ、Reverb 和 Delay 等。通过 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect()<class_FmodAudioBusLayout_method_add_bus_effect>` 将配置加入 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`。多个槽位可共享配置，每个槽位都有独立运行实例和 DSP "
"链。参数变化会更新绑定实例，保留现有 DSP。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:25 637a778a5aac4a98a8bf4d983750d23b
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"to read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, and Record data. The configuration resource stored in a "
"layout does not hold the slot's audio buffers or analysis state."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance()<class_FmodServer_method_get_bus_effect_instance>` "
"读取 Capture、SpectrumAnalyzer 和 Record 的实时数据。布局中的配置资源不保存槽位的音频缓冲或分析状态。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:27 7e98a802207c4fe9a817db349674389f
msgid ""
"For standalone routing, apply an effect directly to a "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` with "
":ref:`apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>` and detach it with "
":ref:`remove_from_bus()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_remove_from_bus>`. A directly attached "
"effect instance belongs to one bus at a time."
msgstr ""
"独立路由可通过 :ref:`FmodAudioEffect.apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>` 将效果器直接挂到 "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`，再通过 "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffect.remove_from_bus()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_remove_from_bus>` "
"移除。直接挂接的效果器实例同时只属于一条总线。"

